{{also|láib}}
==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|de|Leib||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{dercat|de|gem-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|leip}}, from {{inh|de|goh|hleib}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*hlaib}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|en|loaf}}, {{cog|pl|chleb}}, {{cog|ru|хлеб}}. The spelling with ''-ai-'' follows the old [[Upper German]] orthography; it was advocated by grammarians such as {{w|Gottsched}} in order to distinguish from {{m|de|Leib|t=body}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/laɪ̯p/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Laib.ogg}}
* {{homophones|de|Leib}}
* {{rhyme|de|aɪ̯p|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m,(e)s,e:-[alternatively after numerals]|dim=chen,lein}}

# [[loaf]] (of bread), [[wheel]], [[block]] (of cheese)

====Usage notes====
* A fairly rare word in practice because one would usually say {{m|de||ein Brot}}, {{m|de||ein Käse||lit=a bread, a cheese}}, unless there is some need for clarity.

